#: tips.cpp:3
msgid ""
" <p>...that you can start new Konsole sessions by pressing the \"New\" button in the Konsole toolbar?\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...gallwch ddechrau sesiynau Konsole newydd drwy wasgu'r botwm \"Newydd\" ar far offer Konsole?\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:7
msgid ""
" <p>...that pressing and holding the \"New\" button in the Konsole toolbar will allow you to\n"
" select what session type the \"New\" button starts?\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...bod gwasgu a chadw'r botwm \"Newydd\" i lawr yn eich galluogi i\n"
" ddewis pa fath o sesiwn y dechreuir gan y botwm \"Newydd\"?\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:12
msgid ""
" <p>...that pressing Ctrl+Alt+N is the same as clicking the \"New\" button in the toolbar?\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...bod gwasgu Ctrl+Alt+N yr un fath a clicio'r botwm \"Newydd\" ar y bar offer?\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:16
msgid ""
" <p>...that you can cycle through the Konsole sessions by holding down the Shift key and\n"
" pressing the Left or Right Arrow keys?\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...gallwch gylchu trwy'r sesiynau Konsole trwy gadw'r bysell Syflyd (Shift) i lawr\n"
" a gwasgu'r Saeth Chwith neu Dde?\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:21
msgid ""
" <p>...that you can get a 'Linux console-like' terminal? \n"
" <p>Deactivate the Konsole's menubar, toolbar and scrollbar, select the Linux font\n"
" and the Linux Colors schema and apply the full-screen mode. You might also then\n"
" want to set the panel to auto-hide.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...y gallwch gael terfynell 'debygrwydd-terfynell-linux'?\n"
"<p>Dadalluogwch far dewislen, bar offer, a bar sgrolio y Konsole, dewiswch yr wynebfath Linux\n"
" a'r sgema Lliwiau Linux a gweithredwch y modd sgrîn lawn. Efallai hoffech\n"
" wedyn osod y panel i hunan-guddio.\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:28
msgid ""
" <p>...that you can rename your Konsole sessions by clicking with the right mouse\n"
" button and selecting \"Rename session\"? The change will be reflected in the\n"
" Konsole toolbar, making it easier to remember the content of the session.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...y gallwch ailenwi eich sesiynau Konsole drwy glicio â botwm dde'r\n"
" lygoden a dewis \"Ailenwi sesiwn\"? Adlewyrchir y newid yn y\n"
" bar offer Konsole, gan ei gwneud hi'n haws i chi gofio cynnwys y sesiwn.\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:34
msgid ""
" <p>...that you can rename a Konsole session by double-clicking its button\n"
" in the Konsole toolbar?\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...gallwch ailenwi sesiwn Konsole drwy clicio'n ddwbl ar ei fotwm\n"
" yn y bar offer Konsole?\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:39
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can activate the menu with the Ctrl+Alt+M shortcut?\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...gallwch weithredu'r ddewislen â'r byrlwybr Ctrl+Alt+M?\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:43
msgid ""
" <p>...that you can rename your current Konsole session with the Ctrl+Alt+S shortcut?\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...gallwch ailenwi eich sesiwn Konsole cyfredol â'r byrlwybr Ctrl+Alt+S?\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:47
msgid ""
" <p>...that you can create your own session types by using the session\n"
" type editor which you can find under \"Settings/Configure Konsole...\"?\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...gallwch greu mathau sesiwn eich hunan gan ddefnyddio'r golygydd\n"
" mathau sesiwn sydd i'w gael o dan \"Gosodiadau/Ffurfweddu Konsole...\"?\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:52
msgid ""
" <p>...that you can create your own color schemes by using the schema editor\n"
" which you can find under \"Settings/Configure Konsole...\"?\n"
" </p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...gallwch greu sgemâu eich hun gan ddefnyddio'r golygydd\n"
" sgemâu sydd i'w gael o dan \"Gosodiadau/Ffurfweddu Konsole...\"?\n"
" </p>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:58
msgid ""
" <p>...that you can reorder the session buttons in the toolbar with \"View\" menu\n"
" commands or by holding down the Shift and Ctrl keys and pressing the Left or Right \n"
" Arrow keys?\n"
" </p>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...gallwch aildrefnu'r botymau sesiwn yn y bar offer gyda gorchmynion\n"
" yn y ddewislen \"Golwg\" neu drwy ddal y bysyll Shift a Ctrl i lawr\n"
" a gwasgu'r fysell Saeth Chwith neu'r un Dde?\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:65
msgid ""
" <p>...that you can scroll pagewise in the history by holding down the Shift key \n"
" and pressing the Page Up or Page Down keys?\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...gallwch sgrolio fesul tudalen drwy'r hanes drwy ddal y bysell Shift\n"
" i lawr a gwasgu'r fysell PageUp neu'r un PageDown?\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:70
msgid ""
" <p>...that you can scroll linewise in the history by holding down the Shift key \n"
" and pressing the Up or Down Arrow keys?\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...gallwch sgrolio fesul llinell drwy'r hanes drwy ddal y bysell Shift\n"
" i lawr a gwasgu'r fysell Saeth i Fynu neu'r un i Lawr?\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:75
msgid ""
" <p>...that you can insert the clipboard by holding down the Shift key and \n"
" pressing the Insert key?\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...gallwch ryngosod cynnwys y gludfwrdd drwy ddal y bysell Shift i lawr a \n"
" gwasgu'r fysell Insert?\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:80
msgid ""
" <p>...that you can insert the X selection by holding down the Shift and\n"
" Ctrl keys and pressing the Insert key?\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...gallwch ryngosod y  dewisiad X drwy ddal y bysellau Shift a Ctrl i lawr a \n"
" gwasgu'r fysell Insert?\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:85
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can drag &amp; drop selected text?\n"
"\n"
msgstr "<p>...gallwch lusgo a gollwng testun dewisiedig?\n"

#: tips.cpp:89
msgid ""
" <p>...that pressing Ctrl while pasting the selection with the middle mouse\n"
" button will append a carriage return after pasting the selection buffer?\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...bod gwasgu Ctrl tra'n gludo'r dewisiad â'r botwm\n"
" llygoden canol yn atodi nod dychwel wedi gludo'r dewisiad?\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:94
msgid ""
" <p>...that you can turn off the terminal size hint under \"Settings/ Configure Konsole...\"?\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...gallwch ddiffodd y cynghoryn maint terfynell o dan \"Gosodiadau/Ffurfweddu Konsole...\"?\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:98
msgid ""
" <p>...that pressing Ctrl while selecting text will let Konsole ignore line breaks?\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...bod gwasgu'r fysell Ctrl tra'n dewis testun yn caniatáu i Konsole anwybyddu toriadau llinell?\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:102
msgid ""
" <p>...that pressing the Ctrl and Alt keys while selecting text will let Konsole select columns?\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...bod gwasgu'r bysellau Ctrl ac Alt tra'n dewis testun yn caniatáu i Konsole ddewis colofnau?\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:106
msgid ""
" <p>...that when a program evaluates the right mouse button you can still\n"
" get the right mouse button pop-up menu while pressing the Shift key?\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...y gallwch gael hyd i naidlen botwm dde'r\n"
" lygoden er bod rhaglen yn ei enrhifo, drwy wasgu'r fysell Shift?\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:111
msgid ""
" <p>...that when a program evaluates the left mouse button you can still select\n"
" text while pressing the Shift key?\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...y gallwch ddewis testun er bod rhaglen yn enrhifo botwm chwith\n"
" y lygoden, tra'n gwasgu'r fysell Shift?\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:116
msgid ""
" <p>...that you can let Konsole set the current directory as the window title?\n"
" For Bash, put 'export PS1=$PS1\"\\[\\e]0;\\H:\\w\\a\\]\"' in your ~/. bashrc .\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...gallwch ganiatáu i Konsole osod y cyfeiriadur cyfredol yn deitl y ffestr?\n"
" Rhowch 'export PS1=$PS1\"\\[\\e]0;\\H:\\w\\a\\]\"' yn eich ~/.bashrc ar gyfer y plisgyn Bash.\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:121
msgid ""
" <p>...that you can let Konsole set the current directory as the session name?\n"
" For Bash, put 'export PS1=$PS1\"\\[\\e]30;\\H:\\w\\a\\]\"' in your ~/. bashrc .\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...gallwch ganiatáu i Konsole osod y cyfeiriadur cyfredol yn enw'r sesiwn?\n"
" Rhowch 'export PS1=$PS1\"\\[\\e]30;\\H:\\w\\a\\]\"' yn eich ~/.bashrc ar gyfer y plisgyn Bash.\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:126
msgid ""
" <p>...that if you let your shell pass the current directory to Konsole within the prompt\n"
" variable, e.g. for Bash with 'export PS1=$PS1\"\\[\\e]31;\\w\\a\\]\"' in your ~/.bashrc, then\n"
" Konsole can bookmark it, and session management will remember your current working directory\n"
" on non-Linux systems too?\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...os caniatewch i'ch plisgyn basio'r cyfeiriadur cyfredol i Konsole o fewn y newidyn prompt\n"
" e.e. gyda 'export PS1=$PS1\"\\[\\e]31;\\w\\a\\]\"' yn eich ~/.bashrc ar gyfer y plisgyn Bash, yna\n"
" gall Konsole wneud nôd tudalen ohono, a bydd rheoliad sesiwn yn cofio'ch cyfeiriadur cyfredol\n"
" ar gysawdau di-Linux hefyd?\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:133
msgid ""
" <p>...that double-clicking will select a whole word?\n"
" <p>When you don't release the mouse button after the second click you\n"
" can extend your selection by additional words when moving the mouse.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...y bydd clicio'n ddwbl yn dewis gair cyfan?\n"
"<p>Pan na ryddhewch y botwm llygoden wedi'r ail glic gallwch\n"
" estyn eich dewisiad drwy eiriau ychwanegol pan yn symud y lygoden.\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:139
msgid ""
" <p>...that triple-clicking will select a whole line?\n"
" <p>When you don't release the mouse button after the third click you\n"
" can extend your selection by additional lines when moving the mouse.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...bod clicio'n driphlyg yn dewis llinell gyfan?\n"
"<p>Pan na ryddhewch y botwm llygoden wedi'r trydydd clic gallwch\n"
" estyn y dewisiad drwy linellau ychwanegol pan yn symud y lygoden.\n"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:145
msgid ""
" <p>...that if you drag &amp; drop a URL into a Konsole window you are presented with a \n"
" menu giving the option to copy or move the specified file into the current working directory,\n"
" as well as just pasting the URL as text.\n"
" <p>This works with any type of URL which KDE supports.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...os lusgwch a gollyngwch URL i ffenestr Konsole cyflwynir \n"
" dewislen i chi sy'n rhoi'r dewis o gopïo neu symud y ffeil benodol i'r cyfeiriadur gwaith cyfredol,\n"
" yn ogystal â dim ond gludo'r URL ar ffurf testun.\n"
"<p>Gweithia hyn ag unrhyw fath o URL y cynhelir gan KDE.\n"
"\n"

